    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: November 1, 2026</p>

    <p>This policy describes how VENWEY handles information when you visit this website or contact us through it. The contact details shown on this site are <a href="mailto:venweyofficial@gmail.com">venweyofficial@gmail.com</a> and <a href="tel:+919496011781">+91 9496011781</a>.</p>

    <h2>Information you choose to provide</h2>
    <p>The enquiry form asks for your name, email address, the capability you are interested in, and a message about your project. The form uses your device's email application to prepare a draft addressed to VENWEY. Selecting “Send” on the website does not itself transmit the enquiry; you choose whether to send the draft from your email application. If you send it, your email provider will transmit it to us.</p>
    <p>You can also contact us directly by email, telephone, or WhatsApp. The information you share in those conversations is handled by the relevant communication service as well as by VENWEY.</p>

    <h2>How we use enquiries</h2>
    <p>We use enquiries to respond to your request, discuss potential services, and manage our communications with you. This website does not currently send form entries to a website database or form-processing service.</p>

    <h2>Website and third-party services</h2>
    <p>The site does not currently include an analytics platform or intentionally set analytics cookies. The hosting provider may process technical information such as IP address, browser details, and request logs to deliver and protect the site; its practices depend on the provider and hosting configuration.</p>
    <p>The site loads fonts from Google Fonts. If you follow a WhatsApp link, you will use WhatsApp's service. These providers may receive technical data under their own privacy practices. Please review their policies before using those services.</p>

    <h2>Retention and security</h2>
    <p>Enquiries sent to us may remain in our email account and backups for as long as needed to respond, maintain business records, resolve disputes, or meet applicable requirements. You may ask us to delete a message, subject to records we are required or permitted to retain. We take reasonable care with enquiries but cannot guarantee the security of email or the internet.</p>

    <h2>Your requests and contact</h2>
    <p>Depending on the laws that apply to you, you may have rights to request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information. To ask a question or make a privacy request, email <a href="mailto:venweyofficial@gmail.com?subject=Privacy%20request">venweyofficial@gmail.com</a> with “Privacy request” in the subject line.</p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy as the website or our practices change. The date at the top of this page indicates when it was last revised.</p>
</LegalLayout>
